WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.960
Every day, many Jews around the world
study the same page of the Talmud.

2
00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:10.270
Page by page, they finish the whole
Talmud about every seven and a half years.

3
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:14.330
Each page is a conversation:
an ancient text in the centre,

4
00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.490
with commentary wrapped around it.

5
00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:21.320
But if the Torah was written down, why
do Jews say Moses also received a Torah

6
00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:22.970
by word of mouth?

7
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:25.870
In this mission, you'll
follow a chain of teachers,

8
00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.230
from Mount Sinai to the sages.

9
00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:31.700
Then you'll see how spoken
teaching became the Mishnah,

10
00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:34.340
and how debate on it became the Talmud.

11
00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:39.470
Your mission: explain why Jews say a
spoken Torah came with the written one.
